            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Here's a patch that adds the DataSources element to the DTD. It also changes the configuration a bit: instead of specifiying the logical name of a data source as a parameter element, it is now an attribute. This looks nicer I think.",
